+### Transferring a user to another organization
+
+- Only an org admin of `{orgID}` may transfer (403 otherwise); a caller who is
+  not in `{orgID}` gets 404. The user must belong to `{orgID}` (else 404).
+- `toOrgId` must be a different, existing organization (one that has a user or
+  a project), else 400.
+- Org admin rights are per organization: the transferred user is not an org
+  admin in the new one.
+- To keep the model rules, the user leaves all projects of the old
+  organization: their memberships are deleted and the tasks assigned to them
+  are unassigned. All or nothing.
+
